    "description": {
      "value": "These black leather goggle frames have no lenses. Instead, when a character puts them on and invests them, the wearer's eyes transform and lengthen into snail-like eyestalks. The wobbly eyestalks stretch out through the lens holes and up over the wearer's head on lengthened optic nerves. By focusing hard, you can watch for enemies in all directions. You gain all-around vision for 1 minute; during this time, you can't be flanked. When you activate the goggles, you also gain a +2 item bonus to Perception checks involving sight and low- light vision for the duration of the effect."
    },
